// Package genout is the shared output helper of the repository's code
// generators (web/taxgen, tools/toolcountgen and the internal/db migration
// generators taxbackfillgen, reasoninggen and asstbackfillgen).
//
// Each generator used to carry its own byte-identical write helper. WriteFile
// is that helper, kept exactly: it creates the parent directory (0755) when a
// drift gate points the generator at a scratch location, then writes the file
// with os.WriteFile at 0644, so the generated bytes and file modes are what
// they always were.
package genout
